# Cloudflare Pages redirect rules.
#
# Matched top-to-bottom, before the static-asset lookup. Keep the list short:
# Pages caps a project at 2,100 rules and only the first 100 are evaluated
# dynamically, the rest are static-only.

# Bare root → default locale. A 302, not a 301: which locale suits a visitor is a
# per-visitor question, and a permanently-cached redirect would pin them to one
# answer for good.
/                     /fr                   302

# Convenience aliases some visitors will type or that appear in older material.
/pricing              /fr/pricing           302
/blog                 /fr/blog              302
/tarifs               /fr/pricing           301
/fr/prix              /fr/pricing           301

# Legacy nav targets referenced in the OSS README that this site does not serve
# (yet). Sent to the closest real page rather than left to 404.
/templates            /fr                   302
/en/templates         /en                   302
